-------------------
vertices: proof carriers, not runners or arcs
pairwise observable: open-tope/boundary-cocircuit/owner/exact/state/dual/anti-scalar retention
tie Hamiltonian path:
  open_all_safe_tope > boundary_cocircuit_atom > owner_sum_zero_wall > cyclic_tope_morse_graph > endpoint_arrangement_sheaf > moment_dual_shadow > raw_residue_tournament
score_hist: {0: 1, 1: 1, 2: 1, 3: 1, 4: 1, 5: 1, 6: 1}
directed_3cycles: 0
